# QA Capability

This capability provides 3 focused QA modes. Select the mode appropriate for the current QA task.

## Modes

| Mode | Skill | When to Use |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `ui-harness` | `qa` | Building or reviewing a Foundry-owned UI evaluation harness or broader acceptance checklist |
| `playwright-web` | `playwright-interactive` | Running charter-driven web QA through Playwright-based browser automation |
| `flutter-mobile` | `qa` | Planning mobile QA coverage and release-readiness checks until a dedicated Flutter QA skill lands |

